From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:27:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0927/3799] soh: rename D_80A4B7A0 -> sAttackCylinderInit

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: ColliderCylinderInit for colCyl1, with AT_ON | AT_TYPE_ENEMY and AC_NONE, so it is the collider that deals damage.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Goma/z_en_goma.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Goma/z_en_goma.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Goma/z_en_goma.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Goma/z_en_goma.c
index 089d6a563..45a09f90a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Goma/z_en_goma.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Goma/z_en_goma.c
@@ -60,7 +60,8 @@ const ActorInit En_Goma_InitVars = {
     (ActorResetFunc)EnGoma_Reset,
 };
 
-static ColliderCylinderInit D_80A4B7A0 = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80A4B7A0: ColliderCylinderInit for colCyl1, with AT_ON | AT_TYPE_ENEMY and AC_NONE, so it is the collider that deals damage.
+static ColliderCylinderInit sAttackCylinderInit = {  // was D_80A4B7A0 [LLM:HIGH]
     {
         COLTYPE_HIT3,
         AT_ON | AT_TYPE_ENEMY,
@@ -173,7 +174,7 @@ void EnGoma_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
         this->eggSquishAngle = Rand_ZeroOne() * 1000.0f;
         this->actionTimer = 50;
         Collider_InitCylinder(play, &this->colCyl1);
-        Collider_SetCylinder(play, &this->colCyl1, &this->actor, &D_80A4B7A0);
+        Collider_SetCylinder(play, &this->colCyl1, &this->actor, &sAttackCylinderInit);  // was D_80A4B7A0 [LLM:HIGH]
         Collider_InitCylinder(play, &this->colCyl2);
         Collider_SetCylinder(play, &this->colCyl2, &this->actor, &D_80A4B7CC);
     }
@@ -914,4 +915,4 @@ void EnGoma_BossLimb(EnGoma* this, PlayState* play) {
 
 void EnGoma_Reset(void) {
     sSpawnNum = 0;
-}
\ No newline at end of file
+}
